0..77 Comment "// The checker refuses `pop`\'s claims at a shared root and at the wrong list."
78..80 Comment "//"
81..156 Comment "// The model proves `pop` holding the whole root, against the list it pops."
157..226 Comment "// Each item here weakens one of the two, so its claim does not hold."
227..229 Comment "//"
230..309 Comment "// A write needs the whole root, so at a part the arm\'s precondition is `Void`."
310..378 Comment "// At a listed head the read answers that block, so the empty list\'s"
379..402 Comment "// postcondition fails."
403..405 Comment "//"
406..421 Comment "// - see: #2813"
422..495 Comment "// - see: `model/interop/thir/buddy-pop.gandr` — `afterRead`, the arm\'s"
496..530 Comment "//   precondition each item claims"
532..541 Comment "// `Nat`."
